  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">In Burmese culture, people assigned male at birth who exhibit feminine behaviors while serving as spirit mediums; there is some question over the legitimacy of term</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A sexual orientation generally characterized by a lack of sexual attraction or desire</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">People without gender</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Filipino word that translates to both hermaphrodite and a gay slur</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
